   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Eighteen seconds on the N1X.",
   "who": "DHH",
   "status": "said",
   "sources": [
    "n1x"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The installer screen in the photo reads: Installed Omarchy in 0m 18s.",
   "who": "the photo in DHH’s post",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "n1x"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Omarchy can install in less than five seconds on an AMD 495 machine that Anush Elangovan gave DHH.",
   "who": "DHH",
   "status": "said",
   "sources": [
    "five"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The installer screen in the photo reads: Installed Omarchy in 4.79s.",
   "who": "the photo in DHH’s post",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "five"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The sub-five-second install had encryption on.",
   "who": "DHH",
   "status": "said",
   "sources": [
    "enc"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The clock starts when the installer begins its first step, after the questions, and stops after its last, the factory snapshot.",
   "who": "the code",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "clock",
    "steps"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Starting from the stick, answering the questions and the restart are not on the clock.",
   "who": "the code",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "clock",
    "steps"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Preparing the machine’s package keys was 3.72 seconds of a 9.27-second install on a Framework 13, so that work now starts before the disk is written.",
   "who": "the change’s author, DHH",
   "status": "said",
   "sources": [
    "keys"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The slow step that protects the disk password now overlaps with the setup that follows the disk write.",
   "who": "the code",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "overlap"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A first try that set the password’s cost earlier chose a password 20 to 35 percent cheaper to attack, so it was left out.",
   "who": "the change’s author, DHH",
   "status": "said",
   "sources": [
    "derive"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The six-second run was posted by washinkoko.",
   "who": "the post DHH quoted",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "six"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "On that change, the project’s automatic install test took 15.7 seconds on x86, 4.3 less than before, and 23 seconds on ARM, 2.8 more.",
   "who": "the test posted on the change",
   "status": "read",
   "sources": [
    "keys"
   ]
  }
